<title>USA: Omaha cattle up mostly $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle up mostly $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were fairly active, sales were mostly $1.00 higher.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-4 1100-1400 lbs 69.00-70.00, some mostly choice 70.50-71.00. Select 67.00-69.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to largely choice 2-4 1050-1300 lbs 68.50-70.00, few lots 70.50-71.00. Select 65.00-68.50.</p>
</text>
